    "title": "Three LLM inflection points in twelve months",
    "summary": "<p>I gave a keynote at the <a href=\"https://ai.engineer/code/2026\">AI Engineer Code Summit</a> a couple of weeks ago, constructed around the idea that there have been three significant inflection points in the abilities of LLMs and coding agents in the past twelve months.</p> <p>Here's <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9RKrSF9d2SE\">the video</a> of the talk. In this post I'm going to pull out the major inflection point theme and interrogate it more deeply.</p> <p><lite-youtube videoid=\"9R",
